{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>InFlux Redux</strong></i> is a high-def remake of the 2013 ball-rolling puzzler <i><strong>InFlux</strong></i>, built on a brand new engine with completely overhauled graphics, physics and game code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>InFlux</i> is a puzzle game that mixes exploration and platforming in a series of beautiful natural and abstract environments. You are a mysterious metal sphere which falls from the sky, traversing an apparently deserted island dotted with cubic structures of glass and steel. Each glasshouse is a puzzle to be solved. Redux is the same game, except better in every way, having been rewritten from scratch in Unreal Engine 5. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll your way through a series of beautiful and varied naturalistic environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a sequence of mind-bending cubic puzzle structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge an alliance with a majestic and enigmatic humpback whale </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an extensive original soundtrack by composer Jonathan Yandel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We took so long to make this that it is technically a remaster of a remaster of a remaster</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"bfbf1a3928ee8dd506ed3a2d757f4d9ecb443ce2.jpg","localized_name":"Landfall","name":"Landfall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/867150/bfbf1a3928ee8dd506ed3a2d757f4d9ecb443ce2.jpg"},{"icon":"a753e66b2c2aec5bc01a05cfc216807dc3d5ca98.jpg","localized_name":"Megaptera Novaeangliae","name":"Megaptera Novaeangliae","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/867150/a753e66b2c2aec5bc01a05cfc216807dc3d5ca98.jpg"},{"icon":"a0f84ec134187d98d22666e11550114712e3ab8c.jpg","localized_name":"Cracked","name":"Cracked","path":"https: